Hi Kristy,

In your data file, the columns that you have labeled as location.long & location.lat that appear to be UTM x & y coordinates? You will need to change the column names to reflect that. x & y should work.
https://www.movebank.org/cms/movebank-content/movebank-attribute-dictionary

In code #1, you are missing the zone argument in the PROJ4 string.

Please tell me if that doesn't fix everything, but first try to import without the output projection argument, before trying to get that to work.

Best,
Chris

