Hi Kristy,

Thanks for getting back. The next issue here is what Jason just ran into. It appears that the PROJ specification has changed recently (no longer backwards compatible with old UTM specifications) and I needed to update some code to import UTM data correctly. Please try updating from Github and seeing if it works now:

remotes::install_github("ctmm-initiative/ctmm")

but call CRS() on your PROJ string before calling as.telemetry() so that you can see what projections are currently valid. This should work:

nad83 <- CRS("+proj=utm +zone=11 +north +datum=NAD83 +units=m +no_defs")
OrRTtorts_tel <- as.telemetry(OrRTtortslub2,projection=nad83 )

Best,
Chris

